The NEWS file for the lwnetrouter package.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.0.4 - 10/8/2026

Configuration File Format. Altered the format of the 'NetcueUdpPort='
directive to	'NetcueUdpPort<n>=' in the '[Global]' section of
lwnetrouter.conf(5). Altered the format of the 'NetcueUdpRepeat=' directive
to 'NetcueUdpRepeat<n>=' in the '[Global]' section of lwnetrouter.conf(5).

Startup Switches. Added a '--dump-config' switch to lwnetrouterd(8).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.0.3 - 09/30/2026

Fixed a typo in the sample lwnetrouterconf(5) file that had ' NetcueIpAddress'
instead of 'NetcueUdpAddress'.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.0.2 - 06/09/2026

Added 'NetcueUdpAddress<n>=', 'NetcueUdpPort=' and 'NetcueUdpRepeat='
directives to lwnetrouter.conf(5).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.0.1 - 02/27/2018

Bugfixes. See the ChangeLog for details.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.0.0 - 02/21/2018

The first production release.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
